                            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500 flex-shrink-0"></span>
                            <span>Server → Client</span>
                            <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500 font-normal w-full sm:w-auto">Eventos recebidos pelo cliente</span>
